      "revision": 1315245508,
      "text": "Sterculia africana is a species of flowering plant in the family Malvaceae. This deciduous tree is sometimes referred to by the common names African star-chestnut and mopopaja tree. It is distributed throughout Northeast Africa to Arabia."
    },
